/Write a MARIE program to input decimal numbers from the keyboard 
/and store them starting from memory location “HEX 020.” 
/The program should terminate when the user enters a number ‘0’. 
/Note: one decimal number (e.g. 14) to be stored in one memory location.
Loop,       Input
            Skipcond 400    /如果用户输入等于0，就跳过下一行
            Jump storeData  /去存储数据
            Halt
storeData,  StoreI pointer  /把数据存进指针指向的第一个地址
            Load pointer    /加载指针里存的地址值
            Add One         /把指针存的地址值 + 1
            Store pointer   /把更新后的地址存进指针
            Jump Loop

One,        hex 1
pointer,    hex 020